          "message": {
            "text": "The in-memory bytes are the cascade base, not merely another way to extract glyphs. This mirrors Blink handing CTFontCreateForString the current webfont-backed run face. The cluster oracle passes 9/9 with no skips; DOMOTION_WEBFONT_FALLBACK_BASE=0 restores the Times stand-in and changes the partial-webfont cell to the prior Kohinoor-versus-ITF mismatch.",
            "markdown": "The in-memory bytes are the cascade base, not merely another way to extract glyphs. This mirrors Blink handing `CTFontCreateForString` the current webfont-backed run face. The cluster oracle passes 9/9 with no skips; `DOMOTION_WEBFONT_FALLBACK_BASE=0` restores the Times stand-in and changes the partial-webfont cell to the prior Kohinoor-versus-ITF mismatch."
          },
